  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="47f3ce54-3068-5602-b9e5-92005d6a6890" activityNameId="9323e206-3490-5bd8-bae9-a07de126f1c1" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">3kWp slanted-roof installation, CIS, panel, mounted, on roof</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: 3kWp slanted-roof installation, CIS, panel, mounted, on roof
Photovoltaic installation with a capacity of 3kWp and a life time of 30 years installed in Switzerland. The efficiency of CIS PV modules is 14.0% (average of datasheets of major manufacturers in 2018). The share of rejected or replaced PV modules is estimated at 3%. The inverter is assumed to be replaced once during the service life of the PV system.;
Synonyms: copper indium selenide, thin film, CIGS; 
UUID: 76f991ed-2bfa-364b-a313-f77eaf4a645c
All components for the installation of a 3kWp photovoltaic plant, energy use for the mounting, transport of materials and persons to the construction place. Disposal of components after end of life.
Location: Installation in Switzerland.
Technology: Current technology for mounting of panels or laminates, electric installations and other components.
Time period: Average module efficiency in 2018.
Production volume: Total installed capacity in 2018: approximately 2200 MWp in Switzerland.
Sampling: Publication for efficiency, mounting systems and own estimations for other components. 
Extrapolations: Estimations for lifetime of PV modules (30a) and inverters (15a) as well as for transport distances. PV module recycling approximated with datasets for CdTe PV modules.
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_76f991ed-2bfa-364b-a313-f77eaf4a645c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
